+
+The law safety citation is narrower than the surrounding section. Lang/Proofs/LawRun.lean runLaw_never_stuck assumes the closed loader load succeeds. §4.8 describes judgeContextual using loadContextual. The cited theorem does not directly cover that loader. The contextual bridge needs to be stated and cited. The existence of loadLive_libTy for methods does not silently supply the law bridge.
